}}
.src-cat-bar {{
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d97706 0%, #f59e0b 100%);
  opacity: 0.15;
  border-radius: 6px;
}}
.src-cat-info {{
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-size: 12px;
}}
.src-cat-info span {{ color: var(--text-dim); }}
.src-cat-info strong {{ color: var(--accent-navy); font-weight: 600; }}
.fanout-item {{
  font-size: 11px;
  padding: 4px 0;
  color: var(--text);
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
}}
.fanout-item:last-child {{ border-bottom: none; }}
.bottom-grid {{
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 28px;
}}
.bottom-grid .panel {{ height: 100%; }}
.annotation {{
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffbeb 0%, #fef3c7 100%);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
  padding: 14px 18px;
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}}
.annotation p {{
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.6;
}}
.annotation strong {{ color: var(--accent-navy); }}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <header>
    <h1>Data Lakehouse Architecture</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">End-to-end pipeline from 5 source categories through Bronze → Silver → Gold medallion layers to BI & ML consumption</p>
  </header>

  <div class="annotation">
    <p><strong>Insight:</strong> Streaming ingestion handles <strong>1,005 GB/day</strong> (65% of total volume), driven by IoT sensors and application logs. The Bronze layer compresses and deduplicates to <strong>1,560 GB</strong>, which is refined to <strong>445 GB</strong> in Silver and aggregated to <strong>32 GB</strong> of high-value Gold business datasets. Governance controls are automated at ingestion and Bronze, policy-based at Silver and Gold, with cross-layer lineage tracking.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="main-grid">
    <div class="diagram-area">
      <div class="mermaid-wrap">
        <pre class="mermaid">{mermaid_code}</pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Data Governance</h3>
        {gov_html}
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Source Volume</h3>
        {src_cat_html}
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Legend</h3>
        {vol_legend}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-grid">
    <div class="panel">
      <h3>Transformations by Layer</h3>
      {trans_html}
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h3>Gold Layer Fan-out</h3>
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:10px">Each Gold dataset serves multiple consumption endpoints</p>
      {fanout_html}
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h3>Key Metrics</h3>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-navy)">10</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-dim)">Source Systems</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-teal)">3</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-dim)">Ingestion Modes</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-amber)">1,560</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-dim)">GB/day Bronze</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-gold)">32</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-dim)">GB/day Gold</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:12px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-rose)">15</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-dim)">Governance Controls</div>
